  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studiebes&#xF6;k svenska valet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visit Swedish Elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bes&#xF6;k av kambodjanska respresentanter f&#xF6;r National Election Committee (NEC) och tre enskilda organisationer som har st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sida, genom Forum Syd, f&#xF6;r att bidra till v&#xE4;ljarutbildning mm i Kambodja. Syftet &#xE4;r att studera det svenska valsystemet, vilka akt&#xF6;rer som har viktiga roller, och hur svenska skolan f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;ker l&#xE4;ra unga elever om val.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visit by representatives from the Cambodian National Election Committe(NEC) and three NGOs which get Sida support through Forum Syd, for thepromotion of voter education etc in Cambodia. The objective is to study the Swedish election system, what actors play the most importantroles, and how the Swedish schools try to teach pupils about elections</narrative>
  </description>
